name: adr-writing
description: "Records expensive-to-reverse decisions as ADRs. Use when choosing a framework, data model, auth, API style, hosting, or a public contract change."
---

# ADR Writing

Record the why.

## When to use

Framework, data model, auth, API style, hosting, or public contract change.

## Format

Follow any existing repo ADR format. Otherwise store in `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md` with Status, Date, Context, Decision, Consequences, and Alternatives considered.

Link the ADR from `PLAN.md` when the plan depends on it.

## Red flags

- No alternatives listed.
- Docs that describe the diff instead of current behavior.

## Verification

Status is set and the ADR is linked from the plan or change.
